null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_58","text":"Even with all six of them charging at her at once, they couldn't even get close to Guilty. The other participants probably wouldn't dare try, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_59","text":"But seriously, I never thought I'd see someone unleash shockwaves with a single punch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_60","text":"Ugh... My head...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mana_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_61","text":"Allow me to explain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_62","text":"You actually woke up just to explain things? That's some dedication.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_63","text":"This is the latest model in Missilis's line of wearable tech. For now, we're calling it \"Bunny Suit.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_64","text":"Guilty and Sin have both been issued one, and the suits are specifically designed for combat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_65","text":"For Guilty, it even doubles as her restraints, but she can activate Engage Mode whenever she wants.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_66","text":"It allows her to generate shockwaves in the direction of her punches.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_67","text":"The suit has no inherent offensive capabilities, so it basically just turns Guilty into a high-powered fan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_68","text":"The idea is to use the shockwaves to disrupt the opponent's balance, then finish them off with Guilty's crushing strength.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_69","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_69","text":"What about Sin's?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_70","text":"That's a secret. Maybe I'll show you later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_71","text":"That's the end of my explanation. I'm going back to sleep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_72","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_72","text":"Uh, okay... Good night.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_73","text":"*Snore*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_74","text":"Well then, all I have to do is keep one of these coins on me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_75","text":"As long as we keep holding them off like this, I'll be the sole survivor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_76","text":"That means Missilis will win.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_77","text":"We can't win so soon...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mast_m","ade_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_78","text":"Hey, you there! Bunny girls! Let's team up!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_79","text":"Sure! We'll join forces and take them down!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_80","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_80","text":"...Tsk. If that's how it is, let's give it everything we've got.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_81","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_81","text":"Guilty. Whatever happens, don't hurt them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_82","text":"That's not going to be easy... They're really good at fighting...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_83","text":"I guess I'll join you this time, then—","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_84","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_84","text":"*Beeeeeep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_85","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_85","text":"A grating buzzer rings out across Coin Rush.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown1_intermission_01_86